  TypeError: Object of type IndexFlat is not JSON serializable
**Describe the bug**
Index fail to be saved after retrieval training and embedding update, getting `TypeError: Object of type IndexFlat is not JSON serializable`. This also corrupt the existing index json configuration file which is more severe in case not backed-up.
Behaviour is same also if loading the trained model and updating the index and saving.

This issue seems to be related to whether FAISSDocumentStore is loaded with `faiss_index: Optional["faiss.swigfaiss.Index"]`, which then added to the `pipeline_config["params"]` and throws the error while this dictionary is attempted to be dumped to the index json configuration. 

